    "preamble": "Eugine vs State Of Kerala on 4 June, 2024 W. P. (C) Nos. 8298 & 1910 of 2024 ..1.. In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present The Honourable Mr.Justice Mohammed Nias C.P. Tuesday, The 4Th Day Of June 2024 / 14Th Jyaishta, 1946 Wp(C) No. 8298 Of 2024 Petitioner: Eugine, Aged 41 Years, S/O Loordh Jacob, Aji Cottage, St.Andrews, St.Xavier'S College P.O, Thiruvananthapuram, Pin - 695586. By Adv. Sri. L.Rajesh Narayan Respondents: 1 State Of Kerala, Rep By Secretary Local Self Government Department Secretariat, Thiruvananthapuram, Pin - 695001. 2 SECRETARY, KADINNAMKULAM GRAMA PANCHAYATH KAZHAKOOTTAM, CHITTATUMUKU P.O, THIRUVANANTHAPURAM, PIN - 695301. 3 GRIFFITH DAVID, S/O GREGORY DAVID, RESIDING AT 27/1395(1) RISHIMANDALAM, VANCHIYOOR P.O, THIRUVANANTHAPURAM, PIN - 695035. SRI.SYAMANTHAK B.S., GP THIS WRIT PETITION (CIVIL) HAVING BEEN FINALLY HEARD ON 04.06.2024, ALONG WITH WP(C).NO.1910/2024 , THE COURT ON THE SAME DAY DELIVERED THE FOLLOWING: W. P. (C) Nos. 8298 & 1910 of 2024 ..2.. Eugine vs State Of Kerala on 4 June, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/163192517/ 1 IN THE HIGH COURT OF KERALA AT ERNAKULAM PRESENT THE HONOURABLE MR.JUSTICE MOHAMMED NIAS C.P. TUESDAY, THE 4TH DAY OF JUNE 2024 / 14TH JYAISHTA, 1946 WP(C) NO. 1910 OF 2024 PETITIONER: GRIFFITH DAVID, AGED 55 YEARS, S/O. GREGORY DAVID, PRESENTLY RESIDING AT 27/1395 (1), RISHIMANDALAM, VANCHIYOOR P.O, THIRUVANANTHAPURAM, PIN - 695035. BY ADVS.M/S.MOHAN JACOB GEORGE, P.V.PARVATHY, REENA THOMAS, NIGI GEORGE & ANANTHU V.LAL RESPONDENTS: 1 KADINNAMKULAM GRAMA PANCHAYATH, REPRESENTED BY ITS SECRETARY, KAZHAKOOTTAM, MENAMKULAM, CHITTATUMUKU P.O, THIRUVANANTHAPURAM, PIN - 695301. 2 SECRETARY, KADINNAMKULAM GRAMA PANCHAYATH, KAZHAKOOTTAM, MENAMKULAM, CHITTATUMUKU P.O, THIRUVANANTHAPURAM, PIN - 695301. 3 KERALA COASTAL ZONE MANAGEMENT AUTHORITY, REPRESENTED BY ITS SECRETARY, THAMBANOOR, KSRTC BUILDING, 4 TH FLOOR, OVERBRIDGE THAMBANOOR, THIRUVANANTHAPURAM, PIN - 695001. 4 EUGINE,CHRISTURAJA ENGINEERING WORKS, ST. ANDREWS, ST. XAVIERS COLLEGE P.O, THIRUVANANTHAPURAM, PIN - 695586. SRI.PRAKASH M P, SC FOR R3 ADV. SRI.L.RAJESH NARAYAN, FOR R4 SRI.SYAMANTHAK B.S., GP THIS WRIT PETITION (CIVIL) HAVING BEEN FINALLY HEARD ON 04.06.2024, ALONG WITH WP(C).NO.8298/2024, THE COURT ON THE SAME DAY DELIVERED THE FOLLOWING: W. P. (C) Nos. 8298 & 1910 of 2024 ..3.. MOHAMMED NIAS C. P. , J. ================ = = = = = = = = = = = == W. P. (C) Nos. 8298 & 1910 of 2024 Eugine vs State Of Kerala on 4 June, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/163192517/ 2 ============================= Dated this the 4th day of June, 2024 JUDGMENT In WP(C) No. 8298/2024, the writ petitioner challenges the provisional order directing the demolition of a building.",
